    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API allows users to access historical data related to Telecom SIM cards. This endpoint is vital for businesses looking to analyze customer usage patterns, track SIM card activations and deactivations, and enhance operational insights. Typical consumers include telecom operators, data analysts, and customer support teams who require timely access to SIM history for reporting and troubleshooting purposes. Through this API, users can efficiently gather critical data needed for informed decision-making.",
